    "version": "1.0",
    "description": "Clothing and Footwear CPI indices (COICOP CP03) for all 8 currencies. Covers garments, shoes, accessories, and clothing repairs. GBP clothing has declined long-term due to globalisation and offshoring; USD has been near-flat; EUR and AUD have seen modest increases.",
    "currencies": ["USD", "GBP", "EUR", "CAD", "AUD", "CHF", "JPY", "NZD"],
    "indexBase": "2015=100 for GBP, EUR, CAD, CHF, NZD. USD: 1982-84=100 native. AUD: 2011-Q3=100 native. JPY: 2015=100.",
    "sources": {
      "USD": "BLS CPI-U Apparel (CUUR0000SAA), native base 1982-84=100.",
      "GBP": "ONS CPI Clothing and Footwear (COICOP CP03), 2015=100. FRED GBRCP030000IXNBQ (2000-2022), ONS CPI tables 2023-2025.",
      "EUR": "Eurostat HICP Euro area (EA) CP03 Clothing and Footwear, annual average 2015=100. Dataset: prc_hicp_aind.",
      "CAD": "Statistics Canada CPI Clothing and Footwear. FRED CANCP030000IXNBM (2015-2022), Stats Canada annual YoY rates 2023-2025.",
      "AUD": "ABS CPI Clothing and Footwear (COICOP CP03). FRED AUSCP030000IXNBQ (2012-2022), AUSCP030000GYQ annual YoY rates 2023-2025.",
      "CHF": "Swiss FSO CPI Clothing and Footwear (CP03). FRED CP0300CHM086NEST (2005-2025, complete).",
      "JPY": "Statistics Bureau of Japan CPI Clothing and Footwear. FRED JPNCP030000IXNBM (2000-2020, 2015=100); Japan Stats Bureau 2021-2025 (2020=100) chain-linked.",
      "NZD": "Stats NZ CPI Clothing and Footwear (COICOP CP03). FRED NZLCP030000IXNBQ (2007-2022), Stats NZ annual rates 2023-2025."
    },
    "notes": "USD uses BLS native base 1982-84=100. GBP clothing shows a long-run deflationary trend (index fell from ~200 in 1996 to 100 in 2015) reflecting globalisation of garment manufacturing. CHF clothing rose post-2016 reflecting import-price normalisation after the SNB currency cap removal."
  },

